window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Meanwhile, back in Deadwood...the mystery and mayhem continue. </p> <p>Between the butchered body parts, creepy killers, dogged detectives, ghoulish ghosts, and ever-present television cameras, Violet Parker's purple boots are itching to skedaddle. </p> <p>But there is no escaping another murder investigation or her new deadly reputation - even if both risk the lives of those she loves most. </p>"; 
